        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M1" value="&lt;b&gt;M1 — Raw Data Sources&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[CONFIRMED] Raw video and BTC auxiliary evidence&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; KHOA&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; Raw Videos → BTC keyframes → BTC CLIP features → BTC object JSON → YouTube metadata → Optional audio&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Inventory source paths and versions&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; Filesystem and Kaggle Dataset mounts&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; Versioned raw source inventory&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; raw-source-inventory&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Missing file → Version mismatch&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Mark missing evidence; never synthesize raw frames." style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontColor=#172554;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="60" y="100" width="300" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M2" value="&lt;b&gt;M2 — Data Audit&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[CURRENT_TEMPLATE] Metadata and compatibility validation&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; KHOA&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; Raw source inventory&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Existence checks → ID uniqueness → numeric validation → compatibility counts&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; Python manifest validator → ffprobe or equivalent video reader candidate&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; VideoManifest → DataAuditReport → InvalidRecordList&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; video-manifest-vX → data-audit-report-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Corrupt metadata → Duplicate video ID → Incompatible BTC artifacts&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Quarantine invalid records and continue with valid subset." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontColor=#172554;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="390" y="100" width="320" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M3" value="&lt;b&gt;M3 — Unified ID &amp;amp; Temporal Mapping&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[CURRENT_TEMPLATE] Keyframe order is never actual_frame_id&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; KHOA&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; VideoManifest → BTC mappings&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Build bidirectional frame/time/evidence references → Validate actual frame bounds&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; VideoRecord → ShotRecord → FrameRecord → SegmentRecord → FrameMap&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; Canonical records and FrameMap&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; temporal-mapping-store-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Wrong FPS → Off-by-one frame → Orphan feature row&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Reject ambiguous mapping and require raw-video verification." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#dbeafe;strokeColor=#2563eb;fontColor=#172554;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="740" y="100" width="350" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M4" value="&lt;b&gt;M4 — Hybrid Frame Bank Router&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[BASELINE] BTC Auxiliary + Team Retrieval&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; PHAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; Raw Video → BTC artifacts → FrameMap&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Route confirmed BTC evidence and team-selected retrieval frames&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; Parallel frame bank branches&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; Hybrid Frame Bank Manifest&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; hybrid-frame-bank-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Branch unavailable → Mapping divergence&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Use BTC branch plus uniform raw-video fallback." style="shape=rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1210" y="100" width="300" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M41" value="&lt;b&gt;M4.1 — BTC Auxiliary Frame Bank&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[CONFIRMED] Baseline, fallback, debugging and object evidence&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; PHAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; BTC keyframes → BTC CLIP features → BTC object JSON&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Validate counts → Bind keyframes to actual frame mapping&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; Confirmed BTC artifacts&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; BTC FrameRecord and evidence references&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; btc-aux-frame-bank-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Missing keyframe → Feature count mismatch → Object reference mismatch&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Retain available BTC modalities and mark missing evidence." style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1540" y="100" width="320" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M42" value="&lt;b&gt;M4.2 — Team Retrieval Frame Bank&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[BASELINE] BASELINE + CANDIDATE&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; PHAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; Raw Video → VideoRecord&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Shot detect → Duration analysis → Shot-center/adaptive selection → Long-shot fallback → Quality filter → Temporal/visual deduplication → Frame mapping&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; Current template dummy full-video shot and shot center → Candidate TransNetV2 → Candidate adaptive multi-frame → Candidate visual diversity&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; ShotRecord list → FrameRecord list → Frame Bank Manifest&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; team-frame-bank-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Missed cut → Long shot → Duplicate frames → Blur/black/transition frame → Decode error → Wrong mapping&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Maximum temporal gap with uniform frame insertion." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1890" y="100" width="320" height="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M51" value="&lt;b&gt;M5.1 — BTC Visual Feature Loader&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[CONFIRMED] Confirmed CLIP ViT-B/32 features&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; PHAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; BTC feature files → BTC FrameRecord&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Validate row count → normalization and mapping&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; CLIP ViT-B/32 loader&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; BTC FeatureRecord list&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; btc-feature-manifest-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Wrong row alignment&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Disable invalid BTC feature rows." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2320" y="100" width="280" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M52" value="&lt;b&gt;M5.2 — Team Visual Encoder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[CANDIDATE] Model final TBD after benchmark&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; PHAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; Team FrameRecord → Text query contract&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Preprocess → Encode frame/text → Normalize → Record model metadata&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; Current deterministic dummy contract → Candidate CLIP/OpenCLIP compatible encoder&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; Team FeatureRecord list&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; team-frame-features-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Model drift → Preprocessing mismatch → OOM&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Deterministic dummy only for contract tests; BTC features for retrieval fallback." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2620" y="100" width="300" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M53" value="&lt;b&gt;M5.3 — Segment/Clip Representation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[CANDIDATE] Representative sets or pooled clip encoding&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; PHAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; Frame features → Segment intervals&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Representative-vector set → Pooling → Optional clip/video encoding&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; TBD after benchmark&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; Segment representations&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; segment-features-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Over-pooling → Lost short action&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Keep representative frame set without pooling." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2940" y="100" width="280" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M54" value="&lt;b&gt;M5.4 — Object Evidence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[CONFIRMED] BTC confirmed · team extension optional&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; PHAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; BTC Object JSON → Optional team frames&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Bind detections to frame/time → Preserve boxes and confidence&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; BTC Faster R-CNN Inception-ResNet-v2 on Open Images V4 → Optional team detector TBD&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; Object evidence references&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; object-evidence-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Class mismatch → Bad box mapping&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Treat object result as evidence, never identity truth." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3240" y="100" width="310" height="320" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M55" value="&lt;b&gt;M5.5 — OCR Evidence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[OPTIONAL] Optional lexical evidence&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; PHAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; Frames or crops&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Extract text → box → confidence and timestamp&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; OCR model TBD after benchmark&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; OCR spans&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; ocr-evidence-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Blurred text → Wrong script&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Skip OCR branch and preserve uncertainty." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3570" y="100" width="280" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M56" value="&lt;b&gt;M5.6 — ASR Evidence&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[OPTIONAL] Optional speech evidence&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; PHAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; Optional audio&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Transcribe with start/end time and confidence&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; ASR model TBD after benchmark&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; ASR spans&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; asr-evidence-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; No audio → Noise → Language mismatch&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Mark speech evidence unavailable." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="3870" y="100" width="280" height="280" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M57" value="&lt;b&gt;M5.7 — Caption/Event Description&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[CANDIDATE] Caption is evidence, not ground truth&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; PHAT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; Frames → Segments → Optional evidence&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Generate coarse description and role hints with supporting refs&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; Caption model and prompt TBD&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; Versioned coarse descriptions&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; caption-evidence-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Hallucination → Unsupported role&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Use visual/object evidence without caption." style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#ede9fe;strokeColor=#7c3aed;fontColor=#2e1065;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4170" y="100" width="300" height="300" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M6" value="&lt;b&gt;M6 — Index &amp;amp; Storage Builder&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[BASELINE] Multimodal corpus indexes&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; PHUC&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; Frame/segment features → Object/OCR/ASR/Caption/Metadata → FrameMap&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Build vector → lexical → inverted → metadata and temporal stores&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; Current NumPy flat cosine → Target FAISS or compatible ANN → Parquet → DuckDB or SQLite; no graph database baseline&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; BTC/Team/Segment indexes → Lexical indexes → Metadata index → Temporal Mapping Store&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; multimodal-index-bundle-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Stale mapping → Dimension mismatch → Partial index&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Rebuild affected branch; exact NumPy search for small validation sets." style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#1e293b;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4590" y="100" width="340" height="380" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_P02_M7" value="&lt;b&gt;M7 — Skeleton Temporal Catalog&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;[BASELINE] Lightweight whole-corpus catalog, not rich Event Graph&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Owner:&lt;/b&gt; TRI&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Input:&lt;/b&gt; Segments → Representative frames → Embeddings → Evidence refs → Coarse descriptions&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Process:&lt;/b&gt; Create SegmentEventHypothesis → Add CONTAINS/PRECEDES/FOLLOWS/OVERLAPS/ADJACENT&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Implementation:&lt;/b&gt; Deterministic temporal catalog&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Output:&lt;/b&gt; Versioned skeleton catalog with confidence → status and provenance&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Artifact:&lt;/b&gt; skeleton-temporal-catalog-vX&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Failure:&lt;/b&gt; Boundary uncertainty → Missing evidence refs&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Fallback:&lt;/b&gt; Keep minimal interval nodes and deterministic adjacency only." style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=8;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#1e293b;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="4960" y="100" width="340" height="400" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="PAGE_02_E02_01" value="source inventory" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;endFill=1;strokeColor=#334155;" edge="1" parent="1" source="PAGE_02_P02_M1" target="PAGE_02_P02_M2">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
